  "description": "Damie finds herself waking up after a one-night stand with the most notorious playboy in the capital, Acard Valerian. The night was an impulsive decision as she had her heart broken just the day before, when her first love, manipulated by her heinous step-brother, cruelly told her to “find someone else.” \n\nFed up with all of this, she decided to seduce the incredibly handsome man who had just arrived in the North, Acard Valerian, who is not only incredibly beautiful, but also an utterly lustfilled bastard. \n\n“Your face is pretty when you cry.”  \nIt seems he has chosen the wrong opponent and is now playing with fire.\n\n**Original Novel**:  \n[Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H042595569), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6455535), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3049010318)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/episode_page.html?ind=6769), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515022314), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000051395), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8193471), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/cry_prettier), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=220043)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.delitoon.com/detail/daf_1000740), [German](https://www.delitoon.de/detail/dad_2000405)",
